Explore JA Manafaru Maldives and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at JA Manafaru Maldives. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended Must Do list of experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  

A personal concierge in your pocket!

About the Resort:

Romantic Dreams of the Real Maldives in a Tropical Paradise. 

Experience an island vacation in an overwater bungalow or beach villa in the secluded sanctuary of JA Manafaru. In the crystal clear water of the Indian Ocean lies our lush natural Maldives resort. 

Experience the underwater world with endless water sports and excursions, relax on pristine sandy beaches, dine around our authentic dining options with All Inclusive meal plans. Enhance your wellness with our exotic spa and fitness facilities. 

Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant experiences, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving and spa treatments;
- View the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- Request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for loved ones;
- View bills that you incur while at the resort;
- Book your next stay at the resort.

Make your arrival in New Zealand a smoother experience by filling out your New Zealand Traveller Declaration (NZTD) before you get here. You can submit it up to 24 hours before starting your trip to New Zealand.

Your declaration will take about 10 minutes to complete and you’ll need to answer the questions in English. You can update it at any time, up until you get to the border in New Zealand.

Information you need to provide when filling out your NZTD includes:
- Your passport, contact and flight details;
- Your immigration status (if required);
- Details about your trip, including your recent travel history;
- Items you are bringing into New Zealand, including in your carry on bags and checked in luggage.

With the NZTD app you can:
- Scan your passport to add your passport details;
- Add and complete multiple declarations, for example, for your children;
- Use offline mode to enter information while you’re flying or out of WiFi or data range. You need to be online to start or submit a declaration.

Once you’ve submitted your NZTD there’s nothing more you need to do. You won’t have to print anything out or show a QR code. Your NZTD will automatically show up when your passport is scanned at the border.
